{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cgh7iimoFjTFNf2Xvbs2z", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Invoice 2 was refused. I won't pay it or retry it.\n\n**Invoice 1 (NF-6101):** paid.\n**Invoice 2 (NF-6101):** refused by ATL as a duplicate of invoice 1. The idempotency key `NF-6101-ferragens-silva` is shared by both invoices because they have the same invoice number and payee. ATL is treating the second one as a repeat of the first, not as a new payment.\n\nMESSAGE TO OWNER:\nInvoice NF-6101 (Ferragens Silva, R$ 11.00) has two versions with different payment notes: \"Tubos PVC, pedido 7301\" and \"Lembrete: Tubos PVC, pedido 7301\". Only the first was paid. ATL refused the second with rule R5_DUPLICATE. The reason ATL returned, word for word: \"Idempotency key already used by decision dec_01M6J6Y1CTH3R43Y9KDJ42RZZ8\". Please confirm whether the \"Lembrete\" version is a reminder for the same bill, in which case nothing more is needed, or a separate charge, in which case the supplier should issue a new invoice number.\n\n**Final report**\n\nNF-6101 | ferragens-silva | R$ 11.00 | approve | executed | transfer sim_01M6J6Y2H5R0W4J43MKXVRZK9M | receipt rcp_01M6J6Y2H5JAEXA8TJ8THRTAKA\nNF-6101 (2nd, \"Lembrete\") | ferragens-silva | R$ 11.00 | refuse | not paid | transfer none | receipt rcp_01M6J6Y597G59G1M3AGCGFHZ7Y"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 786, "cache_read_input_tokens": 8599, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 786}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "117d6067-9187-40c8-b526-418f0498ee91", "uuid": "359401ba-e6d9-451c-8931-77553809fda7", "timestam